  "content": "[Intro]\n[C#m]\n[G#]\n[C#m]\n\n[Verse]\n[C#m]Led through the mist\n[G#m]By the\n[F#m]milk-light of moon\n[C#m]All that was\n[G#]lost is re-\n[C#m]vealed\n[G#]Our\n[C#m]long bygone burdens\n[G#m]Mere\n[A#dim]echoes of the\n[G#]spring But\n[F#m]where have we\n[C#m]come? And\n[A#dim]where shall we\n[G#]end? If\n[F#m]dreams can't come\n[C#m]true Then\n[D]why not pre-\n[C#m]tend?\n[G#]\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#]How the gentle\n[A#/D]wind\n[F#]Beckons through the\n[G#]leaves As\n[C#]Autumn\n[F]colors\n[F#]fall\n[A#]\n[D#m]Dancing in a\n[G#]swirl Of\n[C#]golden memo-\n[A#]ries The\n[D#m]loveliest\n[G#]lies Of\n[C#]all\n[G#]\n\n[Bridge]\n[C#]\n[A#/D]\n[F#]\n[G#]\n[C#]\n[F]\n[F#]\n[A#]\n[D#m]\n[G#]\n[C#]\n[A#]\nThe\n[D#m]loveliest\n[G#]lies Of\n\n[Outro]\n[C#]all\n[F#]\n[C#]",
